<title>UK: U.S. Everest Reinsurance to open Moscow office.</title>
<headline>U.S. Everest Reinsurance to open Moscow office.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Everest Reinsurance Holdings Inc said its Everest Reinsurance Company will open a representative office in Moscow On January 5, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the office would enhance its ability &quot;to pursue attractive emerging opportunities in that part of the world.&quot;</p>
<p>The office will be managed by Andrei Federovich, who will report to Tatiana Gardesty, Everest Re's underwriting director responsible for central and eastern Europe.</p>
<p>Everest Reinsurance in November acquired a licence to operate in the UK.</p>
<p>Everest Reinsurance Holdings had gross premiums of $759.8 million for the nine months to end September, 1996, an 8.4 percent increase from $701.1 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News 44 171 542 2769</p>
</text>
